==History==
2023
*The Bats' Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 2/10/2023, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/10/2023)|October 2023 Update]].
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor Update (13/11/2023)|Minor Update]], decreased the Evolved Bats' first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.6 seconds).
2024
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Bats' first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.3 seconds).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Bats after death.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Evolved Bats' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] they were placed
2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Bats' hitpoints to 1.2 seconds (from 1.3 seconds).

