==Trivia==
*The Bats resemble the in-life bat species called "''Desmodus rotundus"'', also known as the "[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_vampire_bat Common Vampire Bat]". The Common Vampire Bat is a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hematophagy hematophagous] bat species that primarily feeds on the blood of livestock, which is done by biting their prey while they're sleeping. In Clash Royale, Bats attack in a similar way by biting their enemies.
**In the Japanese language settings of the game, the Bats' name translates to "Swarm of Bats"
*Even though the [[Cards|card]] spawns 5 Bats, the card render displays only 3 Bats.
*The Bats' Evolution is 1 of 3 evolved cards without the diamond evolution symbol anywhere on their card render, the others being [[Ice Spirit/Evolution|Ice Spirit]] and [[Giant Snowball/Evolution|Giant Snowball]].
*The Bats' Evolution is the subject of certain cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Bats' Evolution is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
**The Bats' Evolution is the subject of a [[King's Tower|Tower Skin]].
***It is the only evolved card to be the subject of a Tower Skin.

